      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "openxla\n    - https://openxla.org/xla/architecture\n    - https://openxla.org/xla/contributing\n    - https://openxla.org/xla/developer_guide\n\npyTorch (inherently numpy for linear algebra)\n    - XLA (accelerated linear algebra) from numpy to JAX and equivalent linear algebra libraries\n    - https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/main/community/contribution_guide.html\n\nTensorflow",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "openxla\n    - https://openxla.org/xla/architecture\n    - https://openxla.org/xla/contributing\n    - https://openxla.org/xla/developer_guide\n\npyTorch (inherently numpy for linear algebra)\n    - XLA (accelerated linear algebra) from numpy to JAX and equivalent linear algebra libraries\n    - https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/main/community/contribution_guide.html\n\nTensorflow",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
